   "date": "2017-06-02T20:18:58Z",
   "subject": "How to draw and set attributes from a vector",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I need to do a correlated random draw then using the vector set 3 attributes. set_attribute doesn&#39;t allow storing a vector on a trajectory. <div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s what I&#39;d like to do: </div><div><br><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">function(traj, inputs)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">{</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  load(&quot;copula_objects.RData&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  traj %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  set_attribute(&quot;copula&quot;, function(attrs)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    rMvdc(1, myMvd)[1,]</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  }) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  set_attribute(&quot;aTimeToStartWarfarin&quot;, function(attrs)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    if(inputs$vDrugs$vWarfarin)    attrs[[&quot;copula&quot;]][1] else inputs$vHorizon*365+1</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  }) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  set_attribute(&quot;aTimeDAPTInitialized&quot;, function(attrs)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    if(inputs$vDrugs$vClopidogrel) attrs[[&quot;copula&quot;]][2] else inputs$vHorizon*365+1</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  }) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  set_attribute(&quot;aStartStatin&quot;, function(attrs)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    if(inputs$vDrugs$vSimvastatin) attrs[[&quot;copula&quot;]][3] else inputs$vHorizon*365+1</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  }) </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">}</font></div></div></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">But of course this doesn&#39;t work because rMvdc is a vector. How can this be solved?</font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
